---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---

<footer class="border-t border-[#E8E2D9] bg-[#F3EFEA] mt-24 py-12 text-[#5C6B7A] font-sans text-sm">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 pb-8 border-b border-[#E8E2D9]">
      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <h3 class="text-[#1A2B3C] font-bold text-base mb-2">The Money Margin</h3>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed max-w-xl font-serif">
          A real-world credit and money field guide for 20- and 30-somethings navigating rent, debt, savings, and everyday financial decisions in America. Written by Daniel Reyes from Austin, Texas.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-[#1A2B3C] font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Site Links</h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm font-medium">
          <li><a href={`${base}/articles/`} class="hover:text-[#E67E22] transition-colors">All Articles</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${base}/about/`} class="hover:text-[#E67E22] transition-colors">About Daniel</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${base}/contact/`} class="hover:text-[#E67E22] transition-colors">Contact</a></li>
          <li><a href={`${base}/privacy/`} class="hover:text-[#E67E22] transition-colors">Privacy Policy</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="pt-8 space-y-4 text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#728090]">
      <p class="font-serif italic">
        <strong>Disclaimer:</strong> The content published on The Money Margin is for educational and informational purposes only and represents personal experiences. It does not constitute certified financial, legal, tax, or investment advice. Always consult a licensed financial professional before making major financial commitments.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-between items-start sm:items-center pt-2 border-t border-[#E8E2D9]/60">
        <p>© 2026 The Money Margin. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p class="mt-2 sm:mt-0">Independent personal finance writing.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
